            "review_title": "Review at Da Nang Restaurants Experiences at Hyatt Regency",
            "review_text": "1926yanks\nSeattle, Washington755 contributions\n0\nXanh Restaurant Excellent\nNov 2025 • Friends\nWe did not stay at the Hyatt Regency Resort Da Nang. But we had an excellent meal at the hotel’s Viet restaurant, Xanh. \nChicken salad w/banana blossom -different than the usual papaya salad. Hoi A chicken & rice had a great dressing. And they even brought over an eel dish from one of their other restaurants. We sat at the window by the ocean & were happy the place was open at 3 pm, an odd time for lunch. All dishes tasty!\nWritten November 19, 2025",
