            "review_title": "Review at Da Nang Restaurants Experiences at Hyatt Regency",
            "review_text": "angeandchris\nMelbourne8 contributions\n0\nFABULOUS FOOD\nMar 2024 • Family\nWe stayed at Hyatt Regency Da Nang for a week and enjoyed fantastic family dinners each evening. The settings and decor of each restaurant are unique and 2 of the beach front restaurants have spectacular views. The meats, seafood, fruits, vegetables are all very fresh and the dishes creative and absolutely excellent. You can also enjoy 3 different breakfasts at the hotel's various restaurants. There is a huge variety on offer from traditional Vietnamese, amazing tropical fruits and pastries, healthy options to the heartier western staples. There is a food event on most nights. We especially loved the seafood buffet, the Vietnamese BBQ, Italian buffet and the seafood market nights. Good thing there is a 24/7 gym and fitness programs because we definitely over indulged!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 24, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
